      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.00 (down from ₹8.48 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹4.94b (up 16% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹709.3m (down 17% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 14% (down from 20% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 1.3%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates by 25%. Revenue is forecast to grow 19% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 14% growth forecast for the Medical Equipment industry in Asia. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 23% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 15% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
